---
title: "deleteMember (stem-system: Soft Delete Member)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: supabase.auth.getUser()
    q_auth --> q_no_auth: no user
    q_auth --> q_check_admin: user present
    q_no_auth --> [*]: return error (auth required)
    q_check_admin --> q_query_admin: select is_admin from members
    q_query_admin --> q_not_admin: not admin
    q_query_admin --> q_check_self: is admin
    q_not_admin --> [*]: return error (admin required)
    q_check_self --> q_is_self: user.id == userId
    q_check_self --> q_delete: user.id != userId
    q_is_self --> [*]: return error (cannot delete self)
    q_delete --> q_soft_delete: members.update(deleted_at = now) where userId
    q_soft_delete --> q_error: error
    q_soft_delete --> q_revalidate: success
    q_error --> [*]: return error (delete failed)
    q_revalidate --> [*]: revalidatePath, return success

    note right of q_soft_delete
        INV-001: deletion is soft (sets deleted_at timestamp, row is not removed)
        INV-002: admin cannot delete their own account
    end note
